tool('style','Load a local .style (2019 Boolean return), select an exact unique style, commit current edited style, or change name/description. options: load path,select(default false); select name; update affect_all_uses=true; metadata name,affect_all_uses=true,new_name/description. Switching with unsaved edits needs discard_style_changes=true or prior update. Affects scenes using the style. Root, dry-run, no reliable2019 Undo. No .style export/public2019 Ruby writer.',dict(action=choice('load','select','update','metadata'),options=obj(dict(path=dict(type='string',minLength=5,maxLength=1024),name=text(),select=boolean,discard_style_changes=boolean,affect_all_uses=boolean,new_name=text(),description=dict(type='string',maxLength=1024)))),['action','options'])
tool('model_file','Root-only local SKP/DWG/DXF I/O, input<=64MiB. import_skp loads a definition and places one component at options.origin_mm (default0), optional name, one Undo. import_cad uses2019 Model#import (not2021.1 DefinitionList#import), native translator owns grouping/units/Undo; no atomic rollback promise. CAD needs Pro/installed translator. save_copy saves the whole model to a NEW .skp, version2019(default) or current, keeping current model path. export_cad writes whole model3D DWG/DXF with native options, no2D view exporter. All outputs are new files, no overwrite, no network, SHA256; unexpected sidecars rejected. Dry-run validates path/options only, not file content or translator fidelity. Excluded from batches.',dict(action=choice('import_skp','import_cad','save_copy','export_cad'),path=dict(type='string',minLength=5,maxLength=1024),options=obj(dict(origin_mm=vector,name=text(),version=choice('2019','current'),acad_version=choice('acad_12','acad_13','acad_14','acad_2000','acad_2004','acad_2007','acad_2010','acad_2013'),**{k:boolean for k in ['import_materials','merge_coplanar_faces','orient_faces','preserve_origin','faces_flag','construction_geometry','dimensions','text','edges','materials']}))),['action','path','options'])
